[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21723.67, "timestamp": "06:02:03", "text": "我。我猜我不知道。但是，呃，它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21727.62, "timestamp": "06:02:07", "text": "归根结底，还是靠反复试验。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21729.43, "timestamp": "06:02:09", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21732.07, "timestamp": "06:02:12", "text": "嗯，你为什么要主动发起对话呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21734.39, "timestamp": "06:02:14", "text": "和他们一起？如果我与人互动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21736.15, "timestamp": "06:02:16", "text": "这是第一次，不像我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21738.628, "timestamp": "06:02:18", "text": "会开始和他们随意地交谈"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21741.628, "timestamp": "06:02:21", "text": "私信。但是，但是，但是如果你仔细想想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21744.628, "timestamp": "06:02:24", "text": "不。呃，说到发起……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21748.43, "timestamp": "06:02:28", "text": "对话和第一印象方面的话题，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21753.07, "timestamp": "06:02:33", "text": "嗯，我认为这取决于个人情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21756.23, "timestamp": "06:02:36", "text": "这个人习惯的性质或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21757.83, "timestamp": "06:02:37", "text": "环境、事物或国家"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21760.15, "timestamp": "06:02:40", "text": "我猜也是。我不知道，但我所看到的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21763.51, "timestamp": "06:02:43", "text": "嗯，每当我尝试的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21765.91, "timestamp": "06:02:45", "text": "主动与陌生人搭讪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21769.11, "timestamp": "06:02:49", "text": "或者像某人一样，嗯，是的，第一次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21772.548, "timestamp": "06:02:52", "text": "我想，我大概不做那些正式的事情吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21774.868, "timestamp": "06:02:54", "text": "其实是因为我觉得需要形式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21778.19, "timestamp": "06:02:58", "text": "这会吓跑人们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21779.788, "timestamp": "06:02:59", "text": "它"}]